{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UndirectedIncidenceList","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The vertices are any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hashable"},{"type":"text","text":" values, kept in an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrderedSet"},{"type":"text","text":" whose element "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"i"},{"type":"text","text":" is vertex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"i"},{"type":"text","text":": the vertices listed first, then new members by first appearance. A hyperedge is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set of vertices of any size, the empty set included; repeated hyperedges are kept, each at its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own position "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0..<hyperedgeCount"},{"type":"text","text":", and a member listed twice is stored once. Members are stored"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in vertex-index order."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Storage is compressed sparse rows: the members of every hyperedge in one array, and for every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex its incidence numbers and, beside them, its hyperedge positions, in rows of shared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pools. "},{"code":"memberIndices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"incidentHyperedges(ofIndex:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" are stored "},{"code":"ArraySlice<Int>","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" rows"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read without hashing, and the hypergraph makes a constant number of allocations however many"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices it has. Every vertex-space read hashes its vertex once; index-space reads and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"Hypergraphs","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" algorithms hash none."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Hyperedges can be appended but not removed. Equality ignores the order of the vertices and of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the hyperedges."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps from the vertices and the hyperedges to values can be attached ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PropertyGraph"},{"type":"text","text":"): a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex map is read by vertex index or by vertex, an edge map by hyperedge position."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/UndirectedIncidenceList\/init()","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/UndirectedIncidenceList\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/UndirectedIncidenceList\/init(hyperedges:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/UndirectedIncidenceList\/init(vertices:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/UndirectedIncidenceList\/init(vertices:hyperedges:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/UndirectedIncidenceList\/degree(checked:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/UndirectedIncidenceList\/incidentHyperedges(che